==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 1.67~3.33 seconds<sup>50f~100f</sup>.
*4 [[Heavenly Hippoe]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Blinky Kory]] spawns as the boss after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>, delay 5~10 seconds<sup>150f~300f</sup>.
*5 [[Gabriel]]s spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 40~46.67 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Angelic Gory|Angelic Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Blinky Kory still isn't much of a threat here, only being at 150% magnification. This means [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut Cat]] can tank his [[Mini-Wave]]s for a while, making him a reliable option for taking this ghoulish larper down. Stack [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon Cats]] and [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg Cats]] (as well as optionally [[Valkyrie Cat (Special Cat)|True Valkyrie Cat]]) in the meantime to ensure the Angelic Gories don't rush down Bahamut. [[Tank Cat (Normal Cat)|Eraser Cat]] can handle things on the meatshielding front.

